    "ssky_custom_block_6KCrfB": {
      "type": "ssky-custom-block",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_wEFD9f": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\"The Tuttle Twins have given my kids a solid understanding of free markets and piqued their interest in things I wouldn’t think they would have been able to understand or even be interested in learning. These books are now a central part of our curriculum!\"</p>",
            "font_size": 20,
            "background": "#f6f6f6",
            "text_color": "#0a0a0a",
            "profile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Maya-T-1.png",
            "profile_name": "Amandah",
            "profile_location": "",
            "image_position": "image-left",
            "narrow_width": true
          }
        },
        "text_XUhWXd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Cassandra and her husband have three small childrenand are both very politically involved. They are passionate about liberty, but it goes over their kid’s heads when they have conversations. They had a hard time teaching what liberty means to their children. The whole family was thrilled when the Tuttle Twins came out and made these topics relatable—and the kids ate it up quickly</p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_gFR3tF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>\"We were extremely excited when the Tuttle Twins books came out, which made the ideas of liberty so relatable to our young children. Now they are hungry to learn even more!\"</p>",
            "font_size": 20,
            "background": "#f6f6f6",
            "text_color": "#0a0a0a",
            "profile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Sarah-L-1.png",
            "profile_name": "Cassandra",
            "profile_location": "",
            "image_position": "image-right",
            "narrow_width": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
